	"Description": "Industrial Age is a giant industrial mod that adds over 100+ machines and 500+ items,\n<br />\n<br />It's a really huge industrial mod and it took me 3 months to make it!\n<br />He will also continue to update and various affiliations\n<br />\n<br />It turns Stardew Valley into an industrial game that brings the fun of industry and a whole new way to play\n<br />\n<br />Players can gradually evolve from wooden machines at the beginning to large machines later, and can add supplementary mods to expand their gameplay\n<br />\n<br />Here's its Github link: https://github.com/xc333222/IndustrialAge\n<br />\n<br />We will continue to develop more subsidiary mods for them and how to play their base games, and more details can be found in the relevant media platform accounts of \"shandon Studio\".\n<br />\n<br />I suggest you take a look at the wiki before playing:\n<br />\n<br />This link is its wiki link:[url=http://iawiki.shandon.top/]Wiki link[/url]\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />At present, there are still many problems and bugs, welcome to report on our media platform account!",
